# `docs/*` rather than `docs` so a single file can be re-included below — git cannot
# un-ignore anything inside a directory that is itself excluded.
docs/*
# The CI/CD runbook has to be committed or it cannot do its job: it documents the
# one-time GitHub and Vercel setup that is not reproducible from the repo. Remove this
# line if you would rather keep the whole folder local.
!docs/ci-cd.md
.impeccable
# Test coverage
coverage
